  "solution": "<div><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/678125d2d87d59bac30cc09df4f09c08c299f3b4681b3bb4b4a89d9d2dc573e6.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, giao tuyến của hai mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>J</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>J</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hai đường trung tuyến của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>J</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>≡</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy giao điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math>.</li><li>Trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>K</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>K</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>N</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>∩</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lí Menelaus cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và cát tuyến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"htt